                        "glosses": [
                            "Pampered."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "07e424b0-9ab4-4c04-92d3-07fbcb677895",
                                "sense_id": "2d678c8d-d3fb-335e-b625-751b6a6e97bf",
                                "text": "a cosseted childhood"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc5b170f-4fb5-4a81-8f2c-38f84df8b7b7",
                                "sense_id": "2d678c8d-d3fb-335e-b625-751b6a6e97bf",
                                "text": "When the Parisian-born George Steiner went to Chicago University after the second world war, he found himself sharing a room with an ex-paratrooper, who stared in disbelief at \"a creature so obviously cosseted, sheltered, formally decked out, book-laden, as I was\", Steiner recalled."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bc889d0-de8a-449e-a1a8-dddb97f1f7d9",
                                "sense_id": "2d678c8d-d3fb-335e-b625-751b6a6e97bf",
                                "text": "Independent schools churn out teenagers who are cosseted, snobbish and unable to open a can of beans, Michael Gove’s wife has suggested."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e2bc481-cb36-43a7-a954-b051d6aa692b",
                                "sense_id": "2d678c8d-d3fb-335e-b625-751b6a6e97bf",
                                "text": "Jean-Luc Mélenchon […]is sitting sagely in a restaurant that resembles a mountain chalet yet is located in the cosseted 7th arrondissement of Paris."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
